# UI-WINDOW-1 fix round R2 (R2-1): the four tabs are switches (docs/re/ui.md 5.3), at 1024 x 768.
# Start: the player tab's own panel (hud_idle_running). Bust (870 212) -> the player view at the
# sub-tab it showed last (UI-TABS-1, docs/re/ui.md 5.4: View.dll 0x10034ab0; from the start the
# overview, so the bust from the overview changes nothing - R2's "opens the list" read
# r2_tab_military, which the runner took after key D, actions.jsonl), "?" (931 212) -> info, gears
# (992 212) -> main menu; a click on the selected tab changes nothing;
# keys D and O open the player list and the main menu. Construction (809 212) opens the menu; a
# cell armed there is turned off when another tab is chosen; Esc on the grid closes the menu to
# the player overview, as the original's does also when the menu was opened from another tab
# (UI-PLACE-2, p4_help_b_esc; before it Esc returned to the last panel). A
# click inside a panel is taken (no selection click) and does nothing; so is a click on the
# sub-tab strip left of the column (770 326, x 762..778; fix round R3), on every panel.
# Launch: --play data/maps/lan5.txt --construction-menu on --layout data/ui
resize 1024 768
wait frames 5
look 1140 516
expect fact ui.tab == player
click_px 770 326
wait frames 3
expect fact selection.clicks == 0
click_px 870 212
wait frames 3
expect fact ui.tab == player
key d
wait frames 3
expect fact ui.tab == player_list
click_px 870 212
wait frames 3
expect fact ui.tab == player_list
click_px 770 326
wait frames 3
expect fact selection.clicks == 0
click_px 931 212
wait frames 3
expect fact ui.tab == info
click_px 770 326
wait frames 3
expect fact selection.clicks == 0
click_px 992 212
wait frames 3
expect fact ui.tab == main_menu
click_px 770 326
wait frames 3
expect fact selection.clicks == 0
click_px 992 212
wait frames 3
expect fact ui.tab == main_menu
key d
wait frames 3
expect fact ui.tab == player_list
key o
wait frames 3
expect fact ui.tab == main_menu
click_px 900 600
wait frames 3
expect fact ui.tab == main_menu
expect fact selection.clicks == 0
click_px 809 212
wait frames 3
expect fact ui.tab == construction
click_px 809 212
wait frames 3
expect fact ui.tab == construction
click_px 833 330
wait frames 5
expect title build 501
click_px 931 212
wait frames 5
expect fact ui.tab == info
expect title-lacks build 501
key b
wait frames 3
expect fact ui.tab == construction
key esc
wait frames 3
expect fact ui.tab == player
quit
